<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall in latest auction.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall in latest auction.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of three, six and 12-month treasury bills fell by 0.24, 0.3 and 0.08 percentage points respectively at Wednesday's auction, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     2,777	     1,312	  10.67 (10.91)</p>
<p>    6 months     2,020	     1,160	  11.78 (12.08)</p>
<p>    12 months    1,268		 433	  12.79 (12.87)</p>
<p>    Total	  6,065	     2,905</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
